WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
(marching band music)

00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:21.110
- [Narrator] And bands,
they need instruments.

00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:26.822
Roughly 90% of India's
brass band instruments

00:00:26.822 --> 00:00:28.808
come from this musical alley,

00:00:28.808 --> 00:00:31.877
Jali Kothi Lane, in the City of Meerut.

00:00:31.877 --> 00:00:35.710
- Jali Kothi Lane has
about 100 manufacturers.

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:38.898
- [Narrator] But one of the most renowned

00:00:38.898 --> 00:00:40.648
is Nadir Ali Company.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.976
- [Narrator] And his
uncle wasn't the only one

00:01:00.976 --> 00:01:04.226
with a passion for the family business.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:10.995
(chiming)

